=> Dwight: Max Force!  #line:Start_0100_Dwight
=> Dwight: Hurry, Max Force!  #line:Start_0200_Dwight
=> Dwight: You gotta move fast, Max Force!  #line:Start_0300_Dwight

Dwight: You need to disable the detonators in order, or the submarine will explode, releasing the poison nano-bots!   #line:Start_0400_Dwight

=> Player: On it.   #line:Start_0500_Player
=> Player: Got it.  #line:Start_0600_Player
=> Player: I'm on it.  #line:Start_0700_Player

Player: Hey, while I'm down here, saving the world, maybe I'll find clues about how I was betrayed by the Oversight Committee.   #line:Start_0800_Player

=> Dwight: Betrayed? By the Committee? How?   #line:Start_0900_Dwight
=> Dwight: What do you mean, betrayed?  #line:Start_1000_Dwight
=> Dwight: The Committee would never betray you!  #line:Start_1100_Dwight

=> Player: Don't play dumb, Dwight.  #line:Start_1200_Player
=> Player: You're being naive, Dwight.  #line:Start_1300_Player
=> Player: Don't be stupid, Dwight.  #line:Start_1400_Player

Player: You know they took me off the investigation.   #line:Start_1500_Player

=> Dwight: Into McNeal?   #line:Start_1600_Dwight
=> Dwight: Into the bomber?  #line:Start_1700_Dwight

Player: Yeah. Funny how she disappeared right afterwards and nobody got assigned to find her.   #line:Start_1800_Player
Dwight: You don't mean...   #line:Start_1900_Dwight
Player: The Oversight Committee was protecting her.   #line:Start_2000_Player
